The limit is 10.
The count is 0.
For every number from 1 to limit.
The value is number.
The good is 0, while the turned is 0.
Set good to 1.
Repeat while value is more than 0.
The digit is value modulo 10.
If digit is 3 or digit is 4 or digit is 7, set good to 0.
If digit is 2 or digit is 5 or digit is 6 or digit is 9, set turned to 1.
Set value to value divided by 10.
If value is 0 and good is 1 and turned is 1, add 1 to count.

Show count.
